{"id":"f7968db43124080e","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-dense-linear.md","title":"Dense Linear Order","display":"thm-dense-linear — Dense Linear Order","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-dense-linear","aliases":["58-thm-dense-linear"],"display":"thm-dense-linear — Dense Linear Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-dense-order]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-rational]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-aleph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-dense-linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-dense-linear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dense-linear — Dense Linear Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d434face1aa819d3\" href=\"?note=d434face1aa819d3\" title=\"58-df-dense-order\">58-df-dense-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"58-df-rational\">58-df-rational</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\\in V\">\\(D,R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D^2\">\\(R\\subseteq D^2\\)</span> (a reflexive dense total order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(f:D\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> (order-isomorphism candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S\\)</span> (dense total-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d434face1aa819d3\" href=\"?note=d434face1aa819d3\" title=\"58-df-dense-order\">58-df-dense-order</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear}\\vdash |D|=\\aleph_0\\land\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S(D,R)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists y,z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq z\\bigr)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\mathbb Q\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\leftrightarrow f(x)&lt;f(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear}\\vdash |D|=\\aleph_0\\land\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S(D,R)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists y,z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq z\\bigr)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\mathbb Q\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\leftrightarrow f(x)&lt;f(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All countable dense linear orders without endpoints are order-isomorphic.</li>\n<li>This is the back-and-forth argument.</li>\n<li>Strict comparison on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> is derived from the upstream reflexive order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> by adjoining inequality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dense-order","status":"resolved","id":"d434face1aa819d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dense-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-rational","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-rational]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-aleph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dense-order","status":"resolved","id":"d434face1aa819d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S$ (dense total-order predicate, see [[58-df-dense-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dense\\text{-}linear}\\vdash |D|=\\aleph_0\\land\\mathrm{DenseOrder}_S(D,R)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\exists y,z\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\land y\\neq x\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq z\\bigr)\\to\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=\\mathbb Q\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\leftrightarrow f(x)<f(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1246,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-dense-linear.md|58-thm-dense-linear]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["d434face1aa819d3","36d7463d215be751","21c0965b79ed66aa","2be08d4ee8aa1590","535817bf563314f5"]}